<title>UK: Australian/N.Z. wool prices for October.</title>
<headline>Australian/N.Z. wool prices for October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for October as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 460	  64s 348	  60s 286	  58s 265</p>
<p>   56s 255	  50s 244	  48s 234	  46s 232</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
